      "id": "HtLFPJeL0QTDLEfq",
      "name": "Shoulder Check",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "HtLFPJeL0QTDLEfq",
        "folder": "PPpHbWGF7drhff20",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Shoulder Check",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wearing medium or heavy armor.</p><hr /><p>You hit a foe with your armor to throw them off balance. Make a fist Strike even if you don't have a hand free; if you're wielding a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Gauntlet] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Spiked Gauntlet], you can make a Strike with one of those weapons instead. The Strike gains the following additional results.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] against melee attacks you attempt against it until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is off-guard against the next melee attack you attempt against it before the end of your current turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> You are off-guard against melee attacks the target attempts against you until the end of your next turn.</p>"
          },
